{"4713910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wizard King", "steam_appid": 4713910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713910/extras/82d3572a25ab8245697b393777cb38b2.poster.avif?t=1785436628\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713910/extras/82d3572a25ab8245697b393777cb38b2.webm?t=1785436628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713910/extras/82d3572a25ab8245697b393777cb38b2.mp4?t=1785436628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise again as the Wizard King and fight to reclaim your throne in this fast-paced first-person action RPG. Combine brutal melee combat with devastating magic as you battle through dangerous enemies, and powerful bosses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced first-person melee and magic combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful spells and unique magical abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge and parry focused combat mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character progression and combat upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro inspired graphics and dark fantasy world</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713910/extras/b70073f05c2273546f594a24174d6f2c.poster.avif?t=1785436628\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713910/extras/b70073f05c2273546f594a24174d6f2c.webm?t=1785436628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713910/extras/b70073f05c2273546f594a24174d6f2c.mp4?t=1785436628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Dodge, parry, and strike your way through fast first-person fights against dangerous enemies and bosses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713910/extras/3e96ab429169f4d6727e150481a96365.poster.avif?t=1785436628\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713910/extras/3e96ab429169f4d6727e150481a96365.webm?t=1785436628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713910/extras/3e96ab429169f4d6727e150481a96365.mp4?t=1785436628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Cast powerful spells, unlock new abilities, and mix magic with melee combat to take back your throne.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713910/extras/82d3572a25ab8245697b393777cb38b2.poster.avif?t=1785436628\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713910/extras/82d3572a25ab8245697b393777cb38b2.webm?t=1785436628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713910/extras/82d3572a25ab8245697b393777cb38b2.mp4?t=1785436628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise again as the Wizard King and fight to reclaim your throne in this fast-paced first-person action RPG. Combine brutal melee combat with devastating magic as you battle through dangerous enemies, and powerful bosses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced first-person melee and magic combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful spells and unique magical abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge and parry focused combat mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character progression and combat upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro inspired graphics and dark fantasy world</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713910/extras/b70073f05c2273546f594a24174d6f2c.poster.avif?t=1785436628\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713910/extras/b70073f05c2273546f594a24174d6f2c.webm?t=1785436628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713910/extras/b70073f05c2273546f594a24174d6f2c.mp4?t=1785436628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Dodge, parry, and strike your way through fast first-person fights against dangerous enemies and bosses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713910/extras/3e96ab429169f4d6727e150481a96365.poster.avif?t=1785436628\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713910/extras/3e96ab429169f4d6727e150481a96365.webm?t=1785436628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713910/extr